+# Copyright 2026 SugiyamaLabs.
+# The local control socket (docs/agens.md). The server and its ops build inside
+# //chrome/browser/ui/webui_browser:impl next to the embed glue they call; only the wire format
+# lives here, so the self-check below needs nothing but //base and //url.
